{CHESS Magazine made a hash of typesetting this part-game. I believe the
correct diagram should have been [#] but they presented it with the f1 rook
already on e1 and the note 'Position after 15 KR-K1'. But it only makes sense
if we place the rook back on f1, thus...} 15. Rfe1 Bd4 {(CHESS misses the
latter pair of half-moves altogether)} 16. Bd3 Bxh3 17. gxh3 Qg3+ 18. Kf1 Qxh3+
19. Kg1 Qg3+ 20. Kf1 Qh2 21. Be4 Bxc3 22. Qxc3 Qxh6 {"and White won on move 44.
